OL,4,CFormer council leader quits Reform UK  
OL,5,GA former Reform UK council leader has  
OL,6,Gresigned from the party, citing        
OL,7,G"irreconcilable differences" with      
OL,8,Gother members of the organisation.     
OL,10,FMartin Murray stepped down as leader   
OL,11,Fof Staffordshire County Council in     
OL,12,FOctober, the third Reform leader of    
OL,13,Fthe authority to do so in the last     
OL,14,Fyear.                                  
OL,16,FIn a social media post, Murray said he 
OL,17,Fwould continue as an independent       
OL,18,Fcouncillor for his Cannock division,   
OL,19,Fbut added, "I have concluded that I    
OL,20,Fcan no longer, in all clear            
OL,21,Fconscience, remain a member of the     
OL,22,FStaffordshire Reform Group."      G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
