OL,4,CFormer social club damaged as fire     
OL,5,Cbreaks out                             
OL,6,GA former social club with links to     
OL,7,GCoventry's motor industry has been     
OL,8,Gdamaged in a fire.                     
OL,10,FFlames rose from the Standard Triumph  
OL,11,FClub on Tuesday evening, five months   
OL,12,Fafter the venue closed when the site   
OL,13,Fwas sold.                              
OL,15,FWest Midlands Fire Service said four   
OL,16,Fcrews were tackling the fire on Tile   
OL,17,FHill Lane, adding: "Please avoid the   
OL,18,Farea where possible."                  
OL,20,FThe extent of the damage was not yet   
OL,21,Fclear.                                 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
